{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id333998328"}, "name":{"label":"rkdan59"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-06T07:17:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.3.3"}, "id":{"label":"13719611745"}, "title":{"label":"Great weather app"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve used only one weather app for a long time, for all my outdoor activities, due to its reliability and great interface. I’ve tried 5 other popular weather apps but was not happy in comparison, so deleted them. \n\nI’ve been using Carrot now for a few weeks and think I’ve finally found a weather app better than my previous favorite. I’m still exploring features and settings but will say at this stage I’m a premium member and a fan. Way to go Carrot!! ~Dan", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"4"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id215497991"}, "name":{"label":"livefree1903"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-05T06:20:59-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.3.3"}, "id":{"label":"13715769482"}, "title":{"label":"Not a weather app"}, "content":{"label":"What’s the point of a weather app if it constantly changes the forecast from our hour?\n\nExample, if there’s a 40% chance of rain at 12 PM and then at 1 PM, the forecast is completely different a 0% chance of rain\n\nThat only can this weather app not predict anything or forecast correctly it hides its mistakes by changing the forecast\n\nYou might as well guess every day\nThis app is designed to take time out of your day and keep you inside the CARROT Weather app, instead of just giving us forecast and weather radar\nPaid member for\nWill never come back", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
