{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id216405961"}, "name":{"label":"polkadotpenumbra"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-02T21:29:20-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.3.3"}, "id":{"label":"13707174682"}, "title":{"label":"Why AI?"}, "content":{"label":"I used to really like this app, and it's super reliable for what I need - my job has me out and about, and I like to be prepared and warned ahead of time for what weather to expect - but I just can't let my money go towards AI integration anymore. It's a useless feature for an otherwise very useful app, and it isn't worth polluting water, burning electricity, or funding mega-corps that are lobbying for a dangerous lack of regulation. \nIt really is a shame, I'd love to be able to keep using this app - but I can't justify it if this is what my subscription is going to.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
